  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The standard DICOM-to-BIDS conversion tool for neuroimaging research — actively maintained (v1.4.0, April 2026), Apache-2.0, widely used in multi-site fMRI and structural MRI studies. Assess rather than Adopt due to 279 stars and community governance with a small core maintainer group. Pairs closely with dcm2niix (already Adopt) as the heuristic orchestration layer on top.",
